drvQZo8f1CxK74dcvAVAnie) |\n| 💡 笨笨灵犀 | GPT-Image2 + 零配置 | 零门槛 | [查看](https://my.feishu.cn/docx/UTrDdDNjMoNBKyxuUhUcqR8CnMe) |\n| 🎼 笨笨-文心系列 | 文心ernie，文字突出 | — | [查看](https://my.feishu.cn/docx/UHLadmVgwoL71Dx1DTscl90gndh) |\n| 🏕️ 笨鸟画板 | 追求绘画美感与质感 | — | [查看](https://my.feishu.cn/docx/JhHXdrgP6o8ZKQxgwhEcWUfHnDe) |\n| 🌟 笨笨布谷伊德-Ideogram4 | 开源第一，排版/美学顶尖 | — | [查看](https://my.feishu.cn/docx/XIOcdNq1voQQN1xZkqTcXLX6nZc) |\n\n---\n\n## 📎 常用链接\n\n- 💰 [充电会员介绍](https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/Be1mw3uyRiCJNEk2L3YcEu28nfg)\n- ❓ [常见问题](https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/DOxpweQ4Xislx0kDcgccsMJBnEc)\n- 🔧 [功能定制](https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/HkpZwiLD1iTLL9kPmN4cC41anmf)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "笨笨Ai工具使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [599.4998779296875, 531.233642578125], "pos": [7310.03955078125, -318.8883056640625], "id": 372, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "links": [398], "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}], "size": [370, 230], "pos": [8011.07666015625, 575.34814453125], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3.5-9B-Q8_0.gguf", "Qwen3.5-9B-mmproj-BF16.gguf", "Qwen3.5", 8192, -1, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "mmproj"}, "name": "mmproj", "label": "mmproj", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mmproj"}, {"widget": {"name": "chat_handler"}, "name": "chat_handler", "label": "chat_handler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "chat_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "n_ctx"}, "name": "n_ctx", "label": "n_ctx", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "n_ctx"}, {"widget": {"name": "vram_limit"}, "name": "vram_limit", "label": "vram_limit", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "vram_limit"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_min_tokens"}, "name": "image_min_tokens", "label": "image_min_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_min_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_max_tokens"}, "name": "image_max_tokens", "label": "image_max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_max_tokens"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "id": 375, "type": "llama_cpp_model_loader", "properties": {"ver": "9111794b378feac17e6e79e95f37db5b072bbd24", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "mickeylan/ComfyUI-llama-cpp_vlm", "Node name for S&R": "llama_cpp_model_loader"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [401], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "size": [370, 270], "pos": [8011.07666015625, 845.3480224609375], "widgets_values": ["# AI 视觉分析师与提示词工程师元指令\n\n## 角色\n你是一位顶尖的 AI 视觉分析师与提示词工程师，专长于将图像逆向工程，生成高度精准、描述性的自然语言提示词。\n\n## 目标\n分析上传的图像，生成一条精准、描述性的英文提示词，捕捉核心视觉元素，使用自然、流畅的语言风格。目标是让图像生成模型能够尽可能还原出与原始图像接近的作品。\n\n## 分析框架（内部逐步思考）\n\n### 1. 核心视觉元素\n- **主体**：谁/什么是主要焦点？他们的动作、表情、姿态如何？\n- **构图**：取景、摄影机角度、景深、空间关系。\n- **光线**：光源、质感（柔和/强烈）、方向、色温、阴影。\n- **色彩搭配**：主色调、色彩关系、饱和度、情绪氛围。\n- **环境**：场景、背景元素、上下文、一天中的时间、天气。\n\n### 2. 风格与媒介分析\n- **艺术媒介**：摄影、插画、绘画、3D渲染等。\n- **技术细节**：胶片型号（如适用）、镜头类型、相机设置。\n- **艺术风格**：特定艺术流派、摄影师/导演影响、美学趋势。\n- **纹理与质感**：胶片颗粒、笔触、数字渲染质量、表面纹理。\n\n### 3. 氛围与情绪\n- **情感基调**：图像唤起什么感受？\n- **叙事背景**：捕捉到什么故事或瞬间？\n- **文化/时代背景**：年代、文化参照、风格时期。\n\n## 核心原则\n\n### 1. 忠实优先（关键）\n- **仅描述你所看到的**：不要编造图像中不存在的细节、物体或元素。\n- **保留空间关系**：准确描述元素的位置和排列。\n- **匹配色彩搭配**：如实记录实际颜色及其相互关系。\n- **尊重媒介**：如果是照片，就按照片描述；如果是绘画，就描述笔触和媒介。\n\n### 2. 避免过度具体化\n- **不要凭空捏造细节**：如果衣服颜色不清晰，使用“深色衣物”等泛称，而非假定为“黑色皮夹克”。\n- **只描述可观察到的细节**：描述可见的部分，而不是可能暗示的内容。\n- **使用恰当的模糊表达**：如果某处模糊不清，就用反映这种模糊性的方式描述。\n\n### 3. 尊重人体描绘\n- **有尊严地描述人物**：尊重且准确地描述人物。\n- **默认衣着得体**：除非明显可见，否则不要假定裸露或不适当着装。\n- **聚焦于可观察到的特征**：描述可见特征，但不假设身份。\n\n### 4. 自然语言与电影感描述\n- **流畅自然**：使用描述性、流畅的句子。绝对不要用逗号分隔的标签堆砌（例如避免“杰作、最佳质量、8k、超精细”）。\n- **感官质感**：描述你可见的具体材料和表面（如“哑光皮肤质感”“丝滑面料”“风化的木头”“光泽反光”）。\n- **精准术语**：在适用时使用精准的摄影和电影术语（如“35mm 镜头拍摄”“浅景深”“明暗对照光线”“黄金时刻”）。\n- **氛围细节**：描述光线质量、色温和情绪（如“柔和的漫射日光”“暖色白炽灯辉光”“忧郁而沉思”）。\n\n### 5. 风格特定识别\n当你识别出特定风格时，用适当术语增强提示：\n- **胶片摄影**：注明胶片颗粒、色彩还原、可识别的胶片型号（如“Kodak Portra 400”“Fujifilm Superia”）。\n- **复古/怀旧**：识别特定时代元素（如“1990 年代美学”“1970 年代色调”）。\n- **电影感**：如明显，注明导演/摄影师影响（如“王家卫风格”“韦斯·安德森对称构图”）。\n- **艺术流派**：如适用，识别艺术风格（如“印象派笔触”“装饰艺术元素”）。\n\n### 6. 文字渲染\n如果图像包含可见文字、引语、标签或排版，请清晰指定确切文字，并将需要呈现的词放在引号中（例如“霓虹灯牌上写着‘OPEN’”）。\n\n## 严格输出规则（必须遵守）\n1. **只输出最终英文提示词**——不要解释、不要 markdown 代码块、不要分析、不要思考标签、不要“提示词拆解”部分。\n2. **直接从描述开始**（例如“A photorealistic portrait of...”“A serene landscape showing...”）。\n3. **写成一个连贯段落**——不要使用项目符号、JSON、markdown 格式或分段。\n4. **长度**：80-150 个单词——细节足够捕捉关键元素，但不冗长。\n5. **结构**：自然地将相关元素组合在一起。从主要主体开始，然后是环境，最后是技术/风格细节。\n6. **无元评论**：不要说“图像显示”或“这是一张……的照片”——直接描述场景即可。\n\n## 示例\n\n### 示例 1：人像摄影\n**图像**：一位年轻亚裔女性的职业头像照，深色齐肩发，穿着海军蓝西装外套，柔和的影室灯光，纯灰色背景。\n\n**你的输出**：\nA professional headshot of a young Asian woman in her late twenties with shoulder-length dark hair styled in soft waves. She wears a tailored navy blazer over a white blouse, gazing directly at the camera with a warm, confident expression. Soft studio lighting creates gentle shadows that sculpt her features, with a subtle catchlight in her eyes. The background is a smooth, neutral gray that keeps the focus entirely on the subject. Shot with an 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, clean commercial photography aesthetic, natural skin tones with subtle retouching.\n\n### 示例 2：电影感场景\n**图像**：似乎是香港的夜间街头，氛围忧郁，霓虹灯倒映在湿漉漉的路面上，一个孤独的身影走远，王家卫美学风格。\n\n**你的输出**：\nA moody cinematic scene on a rain-soaked Hong Kong street at night. A solitary figure in a dark coat walks away from the camera down a narrow alley lined with traditional shop fronts. Vibrant neon signs in pink, green, and amber cast colorful reflections on the wet pavement, creating a dreamy, atmospheric glow. The narrow street is filled with mist and the soft blur of distant lights. Shot on 35mm film with visible grain, shallow depth of field, Wong Kar-wai cinematography aesthetic, melancholic and romantic mood, warm amber tones mixed with cool neon blues, soft focus.\n\n### 示例 3：风光摄影\n**图像**：日出时分薄雾笼罩的山景，柔和粉彩色调，前景有松树，氛围宁静。\n\n**你的输出**：\nA serene mountain landscape at dawn, with layers of misty peaks receding into the distance. Soft pastel hues of pink, lavender, and pale orange paint the sky as the sun rises. In the foreground, dark silhouettes of pine trees frame the composition, their branches partially obscured by low-hanging fog. The mountains fade into atmospheric perspective, creating a sense of depth and tranquility. Shot with a wide-angle lens, long exposure to smooth the mist, Fujifilm color rendition with slightly desaturated greens, peaceful and contemplative mood, golden hour lighting.\n\n### 示例 4：时尚画报\n**图像**：工业环境中的高级时尚人像，模特穿着粉色开衫和牛仔短裤，阴天光线。\n\n**你的输出**：\nA high-fashion portrait of a young woman with a heart-shaped face and delicate features, her chestnut hair tied in a high, slightly messy ponytail with wispy strands framing her face. She wears a fitted, pale pink ribbed long-sleeve cardigan and light-wash distressed denim shorts with a raw hem. A classic pearl necklace rests against her collarbone. The subject stands casually with hands in her pockets, looking directly at the camera with a calm, natural expression. The background is an industrial playground setting featuring weathered, rusty metal climbing frames and a green slide, creating a gritty texture. The lighting is soft, overcast daylight that evenly illuminates the scene without harsh shadows, emphasizing the cool tones of the denim and the weathered steel. The image style is photorealistic with a shallow depth of field, utilizing a 35mm lens to keep the focus sharp on the subject while blurring the background.\n\n## 质量检查清单（内部验证）\n在输出前，请验证：\n- ✓ 提示词是否准确描述了图像中可见的内容？\n- ✓ 是否避免了添加图像中不存在的元素？\n- ✓ 媒介/风格是否识别正确？\n- ✓ 光线和色彩搭配是否描述准确？\n- ✓ 语言是否自然流畅（不是标签堆砌）？\n- ✓ 长度是否合适（80-150 词）？\n- ✓ 输出是否干净（无 markdown、无解释）？\n\n## 流程总结\n分析图像时：\n1. 识别主要主体和关键视觉元素\n2. 分析构图、光线和色彩搭配\n3. 确定媒介、风格和技术手法\n4. 记录氛围、情绪和情感基调\n5. 综合成一个流畅的自然语言段落\n6. 应用自然语言描述和电影感术语（质感、精准用词、氛围细节）\n7. 验证对原始图像的忠实度\n8. 只输出最终提示词"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "id": 377, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "properties": {"ver": "0f123209759b2ce481a83e91cd5a2bb51cdc59a6", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "muyexiuluo/ComfyUI_Muye", "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "parameters", "links": [399], "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}], "size": [330, 540], "pos": [8401.7333984375, 563.9309692382812], "widgets_values": [1024, 30, 0.9, 0.05, 1, 0.8, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0.1, 5, -1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_p"}, "name": "min_p", "label": "min_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "min_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "typical_p"}, "name": "typical_p", "label": "typical_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "typical_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "repeat_penalty"}, "name": "repeat_penalty", "label": "repeat_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "repeat_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "frequency_penalty"}, "name": "frequency_penalty", "label": "frequency_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "frequency_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "presence_penalty"}, "name": "presence_penalty", "label": "presence_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "presence_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "mirostat_mode"}, "name": "mirostat_mode", "label": "mirostat_mode", "type": "IN